      "created_at": "2024-04-04T10:27:02.269Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/pradipshah\">@pradipshah</a>,</p>\n<p>Please go to the <strong><a href=\"https://docs.erpnext.com/docs/user/manual/en/document-naming-settings\">Document Naming Settings</a></strong> and set it.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/7/c73759945ba3c43d57d77fd9556cd80270c0a264.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c73759945ba3c43d57d77fd9556cd80270c0a264\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c73759945ba3c43d57d77fd9556cd80270c0a264_2_690x331.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"sqlBoZzXDuCdOBZpvLjt1iFO6Ak\" width=\"690\" height=\"331\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c73759945ba3c43d57d77fd9556cd80270c0a264_2_690x331.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c73759945ba3c43d57d77fd9556cd80270c0a264_2_1035x496.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c73759945ba3c43d57d77fd9556cd80270c0a264_2_1380x662.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×923 59.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
