      "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:58:16.522Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is an option called HR Settings, In that there is a field called “Employee Naming by”, It is a “select” field, So please choose “Employee Number”, Now try to create a new employee, there is new mandatory field displayed, In that you can easily give your own custom series.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/2/524e3506fb2ec011a0d7bbdef0380707cd87b3cd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/524e3506fb2ec011a0d7bbdef0380707cd87b3cd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/2/524e3506fb2ec011a0d7bbdef0380707cd87b3cd_2_690x307.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bK6I3x66VUgAYIqPqX5qCzSzfhb\" width=\"690\" height=\"307\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/2/524e3506fb2ec011a0d7bbdef0380707cd87b3cd_2_690x307.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/2/524e3506fb2ec011a0d7bbdef0380707cd87b3cd_2_1035x460.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/2/524e3506fb2ec011a0d7bbdef0380707cd87b3cd_2_1380x614.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1752×782 50.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
